<title>FINLAND: LANSIVOIMA SAYS HAS MAJORITY.</title>
<headline>LANSIVOIMA SAYS HAS MAJORITY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish energy group Lansivoima Oy said on Wednesday state-owned energy group Imatran Voima Oy's (IVO) holding in Lansivoima rose to over 50 percent in a redemption that made Lansivoima IVO's subsidiary.</p>
<p>&quot;After the deals, Lansivoima becomes Imatran Voima's subsidiary,&quot; Lansivoima said in a statement.</p>
</text>
